ALERT: Agents must read `AGENT=1 cron-person skill` before using this tool.
command: cron-person task run
summary: Manually execute a task inside a target directory
description: Executes the specified command inside the target directory with .cronrc environment variables loaded.
usage: cron-person task run <dir> <command...> [flags]
args:
  - <dir>: Directory path containing .cronrc
  - <command...>: Shell command string to execute
flags:
  --config string: Path to custom configuration file (default: $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/cron-person/config.json)
  -h, --help bool: help for run
  --store string: Path to custom authorization state file (default: $XDG_STATE_HOME/cron-person/allowed.json)
